</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He has broken every fetter,</l><l>I would be like Jesus;</l><l>That my soul may serve Him better,</l><l>I would be like Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All the way from earth to glory,</l><l>I would be like Jesus;</l><l>Telling o’er and o’er the story,</l><l>I would be like Jesus.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
